              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l5.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">5:</span></span>
              
              
              <span id="alg1.l5.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Compute</span> <math id="alg1.l5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="L(q)_{k}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L(q)_{k}</annotation></semantics></math> (Eq. <a href="#A1.E174" title="In A.2.3 Complete Lower Bound ‣ A.2 Evidence Lower Bound ‣ Appendix A Model Inference ‣ Interpretable Generative and Discriminative Learning for Multimodal and Incomplete Clinical Data" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">174</span></a>)

