</div>
</figure>
<div id="S3.SS2.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS2.p3.1" class="ltx_p">We can obtain the final <math id="S3.SS2.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="L(q)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L(q)</annotation></semantics></math> if we introduce both <math id="S3.SS2.p3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="E_{q}\left[\ln(p(\bm{\Theta},\mathbf{t},\mathbf{X}^{\mathcal{M}}))\right]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>q</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝚯</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐭</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>𝐗</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">E_{q}\left[\ln(p(\bm{\Theta},\mathbf{t},\mathbf{X}^{\mathcal{M}}))\right]</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="S3.SS2.p3.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbb{E}_{q}\left[\ln(q(\bm{\Theta}))\right]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mi>q</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝚯</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbb{E}_{q}\left[\ln(q(\bm{\Theta}))\right]</annotation></semantics></math> in Eq. (<a href="#S3.E9" title="In 3.2 Variational Inference ‣ 3 Proposed model ‣ Interpretable Generative and Discriminative Learning for Multimodal and Incomplete Clinical Data" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a>) and simplify as:</p>
<table id="S3.EGx1" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="S3.Ex1"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S3.Ex1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle L(q)=" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mphantom></mphantom></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle L(q)=</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S3.Ex1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\frac{N}{2}\ln|\Sigma_{\mathbf{Z}}|-(2+\frac{N}{2}-\alpha_{0}^{\tau})\ln(\beta^{\tau})-(2+\frac{N}{2}-\alpha_{0}^{\eta})\ln(\beta^{\eta})+\frac{N}{2}\ln|\Sigma_{\mathbf{y}}|+\frac{C}{2}\ln|\Sigma_{\mathbf{U}}|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>𝐙</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mn>0</mn><mi>τ</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>β</mi><mi>τ</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mn>0</mn><mi>η</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>β</mi><mi>η</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>𝐲</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ln</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>𝐔</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\frac{N}{2}\ln|\Sigma_{\mathbf{Z}}|-(2+\frac{N}{2}-\alpha_{0}^{\tau})\ln(\beta^{\tau})-(2+\frac{N}{2}-\alpha_{0}^{\eta})\ln(\beta^{\eta})+\frac{N}{2}\ln|\Sigma_{\mathbf{y}}|+\frac{C}{2}\ln|\Sigma_{\mathbf{U}}|</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="S3.Ex2"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S3.Ex2.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle+\sum_{m}^{M}\bigg[\left(\frac{D}{2}+\alpha_{0}^{\gamma^{\rm(m)}}-2\right)\sum_{\rm d}^{D^{\rm(m)}}\ln(\beta_{\rm d}^{\gamma^{\rm(m)}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>M</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">[</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>D</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mn>0</mn><msup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup></msubsup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mi>d</mi><msup><mi>D</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup></munderover></mstyle><mi>ln</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>β</mi><mi>d</mi><msup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle+\sum_{m}^{M}\bigg[\left(\frac{D}{2}+\alpha_{0}^{\gamma^{\rm(m)}}-2\right)\sum_{\rm d}^{D^{\rm(m)}}\ln(\beta_{\rm d}^{\gamma^{\rm(m)}})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="S3.Ex3"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S3.Ex3.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle+\left(\frac{K}{2}+\alpha_{0}^{\phi^{\rm(m)}}-2\right)\sum_{\rm k}^{K}\ln(\beta_{\rm k}^{\phi^{\rm(m)}})+\sum_{\rm d}^{D^{\rm(m)}}\left(\beta_{0}^{\gamma^{\rm(m)}}\frac{\alpha_{\rm d}^{\gamma^{\rm(m)}}}{\beta_{\rm d}^{\gamma^{\rm(m)}}}\right)+\sum_{\rm k}^{K}\left(\beta_{0}^{\phi^{\rm(m)}}\frac{\alpha_{\rm k}^{\phi^{\rm(m)}}}{\beta_{\rm k}^{\phi^{\rm(m)}}}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>K</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mn>0</mn><msup><mi>ϕ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup></msubsup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>K</mi></munderover></mstyle><mi>ln</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>β</mi><mi>k</mi><msup><mi>ϕ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mi>d</mi><msup><mi>D</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mo>(</mo><msubsup><mi>β</mi><mn>0</mn><msup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup></msubsup><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>d</mi><msup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup></msubsup><msubsup><mi>β</mi><mi>d</mi><msup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>K</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mo>(</mo><msubsup><mi>β</mi><mn>0</mn><msup><mi>ϕ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup></msubsup><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>k</mi><msup><mi>ϕ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup></msubsup><msubsup><mi>β</mi><mi>k</mi><msup><mi>ϕ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup></msubsup></mfrac></mstyle><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle+\left(\frac{K}{2}+\alpha_{0}^{\phi^{\rm(m)}}-2\right)\sum_{\rm k}^{K}\ln(\beta_{\rm k}^{\phi^{\rm(m)}})+\sum_{\rm d}^{D^{\rm(m)}}\left(\beta_{0}^{\gamma^{\rm(m)}}\frac{\alpha_{\rm d}^{\gamma^{\rm(m)}}}{\beta_{\rm d}^{\gamma^{\rm(m)}}}\right)+\sum_{\rm k}^{K}\left(\beta_{0}^{\phi^{\rm(m)}}\frac{\alpha_{\rm k}^{\phi^{\rm(m)}}}{\beta_{\rm k}^{\phi^{\rm(m)}}}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="S3.Ex4"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S3.Ex4.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle+\unmed\sum_{\rm k}^{K}\sum_{\rm d}^{D^{\rm(m)}}\left(\frac{\alpha_{\rm k}^{\delta^{\rm(m)}}\alpha_{\rm d}^{\gamma^{\rm(m)}}}{\beta_{\rm k}^{\delta^{\rm(m)}}\beta_{\rm d}^{\gamma^{\rm(m)}}}\langle\Wkd\rangle\right)\Bigg]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>K</mi></munderover></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mi>d</mi><msup><mi>D</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>k</mi><msup><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>d</mi><msup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup></msubsup></mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>β</mi><mi>k</mi><msup><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>β</mi><mi>d</mi><msup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup></msubsup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mi>w_{k,d}^{(m)}</mi><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle+\unmed\sum_{\rm k}^{K}\sum_{\rm d}^{D^{\rm(m)}}\left(\frac{\alpha_{\rm k}^{\delta^{\rm(m)}}\alpha_{\rm d}^{\gamma^{\rm(m)}}}{\beta_{\rm k}^{\delta^{\rm(m)}}\beta_{\rm d}^{\gamma^{\rm(m)}}}\langle\Wkd\rangle\right)\Bigg]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="S3.Ex5"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S3.Ex5.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle-\sum_{n}^{N}\left(\ln(\sigma(\xi_{\rm n,:}))+\langle\mathbf{y}_{\rm n,:}\rangle\mathbf{t}_{\rm n,:}^{\top}-\unmed(\langle\mathbf{y}_{\rm n,:}\rangle+\xi_{\rm n,:})-\lambda(\xi_{\rm n,:})(\langle\mathbf{y}_{\rm n,:}^{2}\rangle-\xi_{\rm n,:}^{2})\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>N</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>ln</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>ξ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><msub><mi>𝐲</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐭</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><msub><mi>𝐲</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>ξ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>ξ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐲</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>ξ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle-\sum_{n}^{N}\left(\ln(\sigma(\xi_{\rm n,:}))+\langle\mathbf{y}_{\rm n,:}\rangle\mathbf{t}_{\rm n,:}^{\top}-\unmed(\langle\mathbf{y}_{\rm n,:}\rangle+\xi_{\rm n,:})-\lambda(\xi_{\rm n,:})(\langle\mathbf{y}_{\rm n,:}^{2}\rangle-\xi_{\rm n,:}^{2})\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="S3.Ex6"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S3.Ex6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle-\frac{1}{2}\Tr\{\langle\GT\G\rangle\}-\frac{N}{2}\ln|\Sigma_{\G}|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>Tr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><msup><mi>𝐆</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>𝐆</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>𝐆</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle-\frac{1}{2}\Tr\{\langle\GT\G\rangle\}-\frac{N}{2}\ln|\Sigma_{\G}|</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="S3.Ex7"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S3.Ex7.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle+\sum_{m}^{M}\Bigg[\left(\frac{D^{(m)}}{2}+\alpha_{0}^{\lambda^{\rm(m)}}-2\right)\sum_{\rm d}^{D^{\rm(m)}}\ln(\beta_{\rm d}^{\lambda^{\rm(m)}})+\left(\frac{S}{2}+\alpha_{0}^{\delta^{\rm(m)}}-2\right)\sum_{\rm s}^{S^{\rm(m)}}\ln(\beta_{\rm s}^{\delta^{\rm(m)}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>M</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">[</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msup><mi>D</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mn>0</mn><msup><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup></msubsup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mi>d</mi><msup><mi>D</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup></munderover></mstyle><mi>ln</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>β</mi><mi>d</mi><msup><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mn>0</mn><msup><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup></msubsup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mi>s</mi><msup><mi>S</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup></munderover></mstyle><mi>ln</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>β</mi><mi>s</mi><msup><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle+\sum_{m}^{M}\Bigg[\left(\frac{D^{(m)}}{2}+\alpha_{0}^{\lambda^{\rm(m)}}-2\right)\sum_{\rm d}^{D^{\rm(m)}}\ln(\beta_{\rm d}^{\lambda^{\rm(m)}})+\left(\frac{S}{2}+\alpha_{0}^{\delta^{\rm(m)}}-2\right)\sum_{\rm s}^{S^{\rm(m)}}\ln(\beta_{\rm s}^{\delta^{\rm(m)}})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="S3.E10"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S3.E10.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle-(2+\frac{N}{2}-\alpha_{0}^{\psim})\ln(\beta^{\psim})-\left(\frac{D}{2}\ln\left|\Sigma_{\Vm}\right|\right)\Bigg]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mn>0</mn><msup><mi>ψ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup></msubsup><mo rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>ln</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>β</mi><msup><mi>ψ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>D</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mi>ln</mi><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em">|</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><msup><mi>𝐕</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em">|</mo><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle-(2+\frac{N}{2}-\alpha_{0}^{\psim})\ln(\beta^{\psim})-\left(\frac{D}{2}\ln\left|\Sigma_{\Vm}\right|\right)\Bigg]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(10)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S3.SS2.p3.2" class="ltx_p">where <math id="S3.SS2.p3.m4" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="|\cdot|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo fence="false" stretchy="false">|</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">|\cdot|</annotation></semantics></math> denotes the determinant operator. For further mathematical developments of this expression, see the Supplementary Material.</p>
</div>
<div id="S3.SS2.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS2.p4.1" class="ltx_p">The code of the algorithm and the means to reproduce the experiments of this work are publicly available <a href="https://github.com/albello1/OSIRIS.git" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_href">here</a>.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="S3.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">3.3 </span>Posterior predictive distribution</h3>

<div id="S3.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Since the model incorporates two intermediate stages between the input data <math id="S3.SS3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{X}^{\mathcal{M}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>𝐗</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{X}^{\mathcal{M}}</annotation></semantics></math> and the final classification determined by <math id="S3.SS3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝐭</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{t}</annotation></semantics></math>, predictions are performed in a hierarchical manner. Thus, to calculate the posterior predictive distribution, we begin marginalizing the posterior distribution of <math id="S3.SS3.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝐭</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{t}</annotation></semantics></math> over <math id="S3.SS3.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{y}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝐲</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{y}</annotation></semantics></math> for a new data point <math id="S3.SS3.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\xpredin" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\xpredin</annotation></semantics></math> as</p>
<table id="S3.E11" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S3.E11.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="p(\tpredc=1|\xpredin)=\int_{\ypredc}p(\tpredc=1|\ypredc)p(\ypredc|\xpredin)d\ypredc," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><msub><mo>∫</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub></msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p(\tpredc=1|\xpredin)=\int_{\ypredc}p(\tpredc=1|\ypredc)p(\ypredc|\xpredin)d\ypredc,</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(11)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S3.SS3.p1.2" class="ltx_p">where <math id="S3.SS3.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ypredc" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ypredc</annotation></semantics></math> is the <math id="S3.SS3.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>c</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c</annotation></semantics></math>-th column of the regression output of the model.</p>
</div>
<div id="S3.SS3.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS3.p2.1" class="ltx_p">The challenge we face is that Eq. (<a href="#A1.E175" title="In A.3 Posterior predictive distribution ‣ Appendix A Model Inference ‣ Interpretable Generative and Discriminative Learning for Multimodal and Incomplete Clinical Data" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">175</span></a>) does not have an analytical or closed-form solution. Thus, we will perform the approximation presented in <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib5" title="" class="ltx_ref">5</a>]</cite>, which let us rewrite Eq. (<a href="#A1.E175" title="In A.3 Posterior predictive distribution ‣ Appendix A Model Inference ‣ Interpretable Generative and Discriminative Learning for Multimodal and Incomplete Clinical Data" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">175</span></a>) as</p>
<table id="S3.E12" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S3.E12.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="p(\tpredc=1|\xpredin)\simeq\sigma\left(\frac{\langle\ypredc\rangle}{(1+\frac{\pi}{8}\Sigma_{\ypredc})^{\unmed}}\right)." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>≃</mo><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub></msub></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup></mfrac><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p(\tpredc=1|\xpredin)\simeq\sigma\left(\frac{\langle\ypredc\rangle}{(1+\frac{\pi}{8}\Sigma_{\ypredc})^{\unmed}}\right).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(12)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S3.SS3.p2.2" class="ltx_p">where <math id="S3.SS3.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Phi(\cdot)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Phi(\cdot)</annotation></semantics></math> is the probit function.</p>
</div>
<div id="S3.SS3.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS3.p3.1" class="ltx_p">Now, to infer the parameters <math id="S3.SS3.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\langle\ypredc\rangle" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\langle\ypredc\rangle</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="S3.SS3.p3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Sigma_{\ypredc}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Sigma_{\ypredc}</annotation></semantics></math>, it is necessary to parameterize <math id="S3.SS3.p3.m3" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="p(\ypredc|\xpredin)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p(\ypredc|\xpredin)</annotation></semantics></math>. This involves marginalizing over the main model variables as</p>
<table id="S3.E13" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S3.E13.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="p(\ypredc|\xpredin)=\int p(\ypredc|\bm{\Theta})p\left(\bm{\Theta}|\xpredin\right)d\bm{\Theta}," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mo>∫</mo><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝚯</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>𝚯</mi><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi></msup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>𝚯</mi><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p(\ypredc|\xpredin)=\int p(\ypredc|\bm{\Theta})p\left(\bm{\Theta}|\xpredin\right)d\bm{\Theta},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(13)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S3.SS3.p3.2" class="ltx_p">where <math id="S3.SS3.p3.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bm{\Theta}=\{\Z,\G,\U,\mathbf{V}^{\Y},\eta\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝚯</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mi>𝐙</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐆</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐔</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>𝐕</mi><mi>𝐘</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><mi>η</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bm{\Theta}=\{\Z,\G,\U,\mathbf{V}^{\Y},\eta\}</annotation></semantics></math>. Having developed mean-field inference over the model variables, we can rewrite Eq. (<a href="#A1.E180" title="In A.3 Posterior predictive distribution ‣ Appendix A Model Inference ‣ Interpretable Generative and Discriminative Learning for Multimodal and Incomplete Clinical Data" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">180</span></a>) employing the obtained approximate posterior distributions as follows:</p>
<table id="S3.E14" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S3.E14.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\begin{split}p(\ypredc|\xpredin)=&amp;\int_{\mathbf{z}_{\rm*,:}}\int_{\mathbf{g}_{\rm*,:}}\int_{\mathbf{u}_{\rm c,:}}\int_{\mathbf{v}_{\rm c,:}^{\Y}}\int_{\eta}N(\ypredc|\mathbf{z}_{\rm*,:}\mathbf{u}_{\rm c,:}^{\top}+\mathbf{g}_{\rm*,:}\mathbf{v}_{\rm c,:}^{\mathbf{Y}\top},\eta^{-1})q(\mathbf{z}_{\rm*,:})q(\mathbf{g}_{\rm*,:})\\
&amp;q(\mathbf{u}_{\rm c,:})q(\mathbf{v}_{\rm c,:}^{\Y})q(\eta)d\mathbf{z}_{\rm*,:}d\mathbf{g}_{\rm*,:}d\mathbf{u}_{\rm c,:}d\mathbf{v}_{\rm c,:}^{\mathbf{Y}\top}d\eta.\end{split}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mtable columnspacing="0pt" displaystyle="true" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_right" columnalign="right"><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>=</mo></mrow></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∫</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow></msub><mo rspace="0em">∫</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>𝐠</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow></msub><mo rspace="0em">∫</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>𝐮</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow></msub><mo rspace="0em">∫</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>𝐯</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>𝐘</mi></msup></mrow></msub><mo>∫</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>η</mi></msub><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><mi>𝐮</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>𝐠</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><mi>𝐯</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>𝐘</mi><mo lspace="0.222em">⊤</mo></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mi>η</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐠</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐮</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐯</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>𝐘</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>η</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><mi>d</mi><mi>𝐠</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><mi>d</mi><mi>𝐮</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><mi>d</mi><mi>𝐯</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>𝐘</mi><mo lspace="0.222em">⊤</mo></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>η</mi><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\begin{split}p(\ypredc|\xpredin)=&amp;\int_{\mathbf{z}_{\rm*,:}}\int_{\mathbf{g}_{\rm*,:}}\int_{\mathbf{u}_{\rm c,:}}\int_{\mathbf{v}_{\rm c,:}^{\Y}}\int_{\eta}N(\ypredc|\mathbf{z}_{\rm*,:}\mathbf{u}_{\rm c,:}^{\top}+\mathbf{g}_{\rm*,:}\mathbf{v}_{\rm c,:}^{\mathbf{Y}\top},\eta^{-1})q(\mathbf{z}_{\rm*,:})q(\mathbf{g}_{\rm*,:})\\
&amp;q(\mathbf{u}_{\rm c,:})q(\mathbf{v}_{\rm c,:}^{\Y})q(\eta)d\mathbf{z}_{\rm*,:}d\mathbf{g}_{\rm*,:}d\mathbf{u}_{\rm c,:}d\mathbf{v}_{\rm c,:}^{\mathbf{Y}\top}d\eta.\end{split}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(14)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="S3.SS3.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS3.p4.1" class="ltx_p">Thus, operating over Eq. (<a href="#A1.E181" title="In A.3 Posterior predictive distribution ‣ Appendix A Model Inference ‣ Interpretable Generative and Discriminative Learning for Multimodal and Incomplete Clinical Data" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">181</span></a>), we can calculate analitically the mean as</p>
<table id="S3.E15" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S3.E15.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\mathbb{E}[\ypredc]=\mathbb{E}[\mathbf{z}_{\rm*,:}\mathbf{u}_{c,:}^{\top}+\mathbf{g}_{\rm*,:}\mathbf{v}_{c,:}^{\mathbf{Y}\top}+\epsilon_{Y}]=\langle\mathbf{z}_{\rm*,:}\rangle\langle\mathbf{u}_{c,:}^{\top}\rangle+\langle\mathbf{g}_{\rm*,:}\rangle\langle\mathbf{v}_{c,:}^{\mathbf{Y}\top}\rangle," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><msubsup><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>𝐠</mi><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><msubsup><mi>𝐯</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>𝐘</mi><mo lspace="0.222em">⊤</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mi>Y</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><msub><mi>𝐠</mi><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐯</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>𝐘</mi><mo lspace="0.222em">⊤</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbb{E}[\ypredc]=\mathbb{E}[\mathbf{z}_{\rm*,:}\mathbf{u}_{c,:}^{\top}+\mathbf{g}_{\rm*,:}\mathbf{v}_{c,:}^{\mathbf{Y}\top}+\epsilon_{Y}]=\langle\mathbf{z}_{\rm*,:}\rangle\langle\mathbf{u}_{c,:}^{\top}\rangle+\langle\mathbf{g}_{\rm*,:}\rangle\langle\mathbf{v}_{c,:}^{\mathbf{Y}\top}\rangle,</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(15)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S3.SS3.p4.2" class="ltx_p">and the variance</p>
<table id="S3.E16" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S3.E16.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\begin{split}Var[\ypredc]&amp;=\langle\eta\rangle+\sum_{k}^{K}\Big(\Sigma_{\text{z}_{\rm*,k}}\Sigma_{\text{u}_{\rm c,k}}+\langle\text{z}_{\rm*,k}\rangle\langle\text{z}_{\rm*,k}\rangle\Sigma_{\text{u}_{\rm c,k}}+\langle\text{u}_{\rm c,k}\rangle\langle\text{u}_{\rm c,k}\rangle\Sigma_{\mathbf{z}_{\rm*,k}}\Big)\\
&amp;+\sum_{s}^{S}\Big(\Sigma_{\mathbf{g}_{\rm*,s}}\Sigma_{\mathbf{v}_{\rm c,s}^{Y}}+\langle\mathbf{g}_{\rm*,s}\rangle\langle\mathbf{g}_{\rm*,s}\rangle\Sigma_{\mathbf{v}^{Y}_{\rm c,s}}+\langle\mathbf{v}^{Y}_{\rm c,s}\rangle\langle\mathbf{v}^{Y}_{\rm c,s}\rangle\Sigma_{\mathbf{g}_{\rm*,s}}\Big).\end{split}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mtable columnspacing="0pt" displaystyle="true" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_right" columnalign="right"><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mi>η</mi><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em">+</mo><mrow><munderover><mo movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>K</mi></munderover><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><msub><mtext>z</mtext><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><msub><mtext>u</mtext><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><msub><mtext>z</mtext><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><msub><mtext>z</mtext><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><msub><mtext>u</mtext><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><msub><mtext>u</mtext><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><msub><mtext>u</mtext><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub></msub></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mo rspace="0.055em">+</mo><mo movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>s</mi></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>S</mi></msup><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><msub><mi>𝐠</mi><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐯</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow><mi>Y</mi></msubsup></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mi>𝐠</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mi>𝐠</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐯</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow><mi>Y</mi></msubsup></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mi>𝐯</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>Y</mi></msup><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mi>𝐯</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>Y</mi></msup><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><msub><mi>𝐠</mi><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></msub><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\begin{split}Var[\ypredc]&amp;=\langle\eta\rangle+\sum_{k}^{K}\Big(\Sigma_{\text{z}_{\rm*,k}}\Sigma_{\text{u}_{\rm c,k}}+\langle\text{z}_{\rm*,k}\rangle\langle\text{z}_{\rm*,k}\rangle\Sigma_{\text{u}_{\rm c,k}}+\langle\text{u}_{\rm c,k}\rangle\langle\text{u}_{\rm c,k}\rangle\Sigma_{\mathbf{z}_{\rm*,k}}\Big)\\
&amp;+\sum_{s}^{S}\Big(\Sigma_{\mathbf{g}_{\rm*,s}}\Sigma_{\mathbf{v}_{\rm c,s}^{Y}}+\langle\mathbf{g}_{\rm*,s}\rangle\langle\mathbf{g}_{\rm*,s}\rangle\Sigma_{\mathbf{v}^{Y}_{\rm c,s}}+\langle\mathbf{v}^{Y}_{\rm c,s}\rangle\langle\mathbf{v}^{Y}_{\rm c,s}\rangle\Sigma_{\mathbf{g}_{\rm*,s}}\Big).\end{split}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(16)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="S3.SS3.p5" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS3.p5.1" class="ltx_p">In that way, Eq. (<a href="#A1.E183" title="In A.3 Posterior predictive distribution ‣ Appendix A Model Inference ‣ Interpretable Generative and Discriminative Learning for Multimodal and Incomplete Clinical Data" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">183</span></a>) can be used for the hard prediction<span id="footnote2" class="ltx_note ltx_role_footnote"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">2</sup><span class="ltx_note_outer"><span class="ltx_note_content"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">2</sup>
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_note">2</span>
              
              
              
            As a Gaussian distribution, the expectation corresponds to the mean, mode, and median, which are the same. Thus, the expectation could be used a trustworthy predictor.</span></span></span> while Eq. (<a href="#A1.E186" title="In A.3 Posterior predictive distribution ‣ Appendix A Model Inference ‣ Interpretable Generative and Discriminative Learning for Multimodal and Incomplete Clinical Data" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">186</span></a>) to estimate the uncertainity of the prediction. As explained at Section <a href="#S1" title="1 Introduction ‣ Interpretable Generative and Discriminative Learning for Multimodal and Incomplete Clinical Data" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>, this uncertainity estimation is crucial when working in biomedical settings.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="S3.SS4" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">3.4 </span>Missing data imputation</h3>

<div id="S3.SS4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">To address missing values and enable semi-supervised training, we treat the missing entries as additional random variables to be inferred. Let <math id="S3.SS4.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="U" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>U</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">U</annotation></semantics></math> denote the set of unobserved features and <math id="S3.SS4.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="O" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>O</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">O</annotation></semantics></math> the set of observed ones. For a given data point in modality <math id="S3.SS4.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>m</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m</annotation></semantics></math>, we write <math id="S3.SS4.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{x}_{*,U}^{(m)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>U</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{x}_{*,U}^{(m)}</annotation></semantics></math> for the unobserved features and <math id="S3.SS4.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{x}_{*,O}^{(m)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>O</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{x}_{*,O}^{(m)}</annotation></semantics></math> for the observed ones. The posterior distribution of the missing entries can then be expressed as</p>
<table id="S3.E17" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S3.E17.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="p(\mathbf{x}_{*,U}^{(m)}\mid\mathbf{x}_{*,O}^{(m)},\bm{\Theta})=\prod_{m=1}^{\mathcal{M}}\int p(\mathbf{x}^{(m)}_{*,U}\mid\mathbf{g}_{*,:},\bm{\Theta})\,p(\mathbf{g}_{*,:}\mid\mathbf{x}_{*,O}^{\mathcal{M}},\bm{\Theta})\,d\bm{\Theta}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>U</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>O</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><mi>𝚯</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><munderover><mo movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∏</mo><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi></munderover><mo>∫</mo><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>U</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><msub><mi>𝐠</mi><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝚯</mi><mo rspace="0.170em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐠</mi><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>O</mi></mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><mi>𝚯</mi><mo rspace="0.170em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>𝚯</mi><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p(\mathbf{x}_{*,U}^{(m)}\mid\mathbf{x}_{*,O}^{(m)},\bm{\Theta})=\prod_{m=1}^{\mathcal{M}}\int p(\mathbf{x}^{(m)}_{*,U}\mid\mathbf{g}_{*,:},\bm{\Theta})\,p(\mathbf{g}_{*,:}\mid\mathbf{x}_{*,O}^{\mathcal{M}},\bm{\Theta})\,d\bm{\Theta}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(17)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="S3.SS4.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS4.p2.1" class="ltx_p">The posterior mean and variance of the unobserved features are given by</p>
<table id="S3.E18" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S3.E18.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\langle\mathbf{x}_{*,U}^{(m)}\rangle=\langle\mathbf{g}_{*,:}\rangle\langle\mathbf{V}_{U,:}^{(m)\top}\rangle," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>U</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><msub><mi>𝐠</mi><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐕</mi><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em">⊤</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\langle\mathbf{x}_{*,U}^{(m)}\rangle=\langle\mathbf{g}_{*,:}\rangle\langle\mathbf{V}_{U,:}^{(m)\top}\rangle,</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(18)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S3.SS4.p2.2" class="ltx_p">and</p>
<table id="S3.E19" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S3.E19.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\Sigma_{\mathbf{x}_{*,U}^{(m)}}=\langle\psi^{(m)}\rangle^{-1}+\Sigma_{\mathbf{g}_{*,:}}\Sigma_{\mathbf{V}_{U,:}^{(m)}}+\langle\mathbf{g}_{*,:}\mathbf{g}_{*,:}^{\top}\rangle\Sigma_{\mathbf{V}_{U,:}^{(m)}}+\langle\mathbf{v}_{u,:}^{(m)}\mathbf{v}_{u,:}^{(m)\top}\rangle\Sigma_{\mathbf{g}_{*,:}}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>U</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><msup><mi>ψ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mrow><mi>𝐠</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow></msub><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mrow><mi>𝐕</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><msub><mi>𝐠</mi><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><msubsup><mi>𝐠</mi><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mrow><mi>𝐕</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐯</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><msubsup><mi>𝐯</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em">⊤</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mrow><mi>𝐠</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Sigma_{\mathbf{x}_{*,U}^{(m)}}=\langle\psi^{(m)}\rangle^{-1}+\Sigma_{\mathbf{g}_{*,:}}\Sigma_{\mathbf{V}_{U,:}^{(m)}}+\langle\mathbf{g}_{*,:}\mathbf{g}_{*,:}^{\top}\rangle\Sigma_{\mathbf{V}_{U,:}^{(m)}}+\langle\mathbf{v}_{u,:}^{(m)}\mathbf{v}_{u,:}^{(m)\top}\rangle\Sigma_{\mathbf{g}_{*,:}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(19)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="S3.SS4.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS4.p3.1" class="ltx_p">Finally, the marginal posterior distribution of <math id="S3.SS4.p3.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\mathbf{g}_{*,:}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝐠</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{g}_{*,:}</annotation></semantics></math> is computed as</p>
<table id="S3.E20" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S3.E20.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\Sigma_{\mathbf{G}}^{-1}=\Is+\langle\eta\rangle\langle\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}\top}\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}}\rangle+\sum_{m=1}^{\mathcal{M}}\langle\psi^{(m)}\rangle\langle\mathbf{V}_{U,:}^{(m)\top}\mathbf{V}_{U,:}^{(m)}\rangle," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>𝐆</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>𝐈</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mi>η</mi><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><msup><mi>𝐕</mi><mrow><mi>𝐘</mi><mo lspace="0.222em">⊤</mo></mrow></msup><msup><mi>𝐕</mi><mi>𝐘</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em">+</mo><munderover><mo movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi></munderover><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><msup><mi>ψ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐕</mi><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em">⊤</mo></mrow></msubsup><msubsup><mi>𝐕</mi><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Sigma_{\mathbf{G}}^{-1}=\Is+\langle\eta\rangle\langle\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}\top}\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}}\rangle+\sum_{m=1}^{\mathcal{M}}\langle\psi^{(m)}\rangle\langle\mathbf{V}_{U,:}^{(m)\top}\mathbf{V}_{U,:}^{(m)}\rangle,</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(20)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S3.SS4.p3.2" class="ltx_p">with mean</p>
<table id="S3.E21" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S3.E21.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\langle\mathbf{g}_{*,:}\rangle=\Bigg(\sum_{m=1}^{\mathcal{M}}\langle\psi^{(m)}\rangle\langle\mathbf{x}_{*,U}^{(m)}\rangle\langle\mathbf{V}_{U,:}^{(m)}\rangle+\langle\eta\rangle\big(\langle\mathbf{y}_{*,:}\rangle-\langle\mathbf{z}_{*,:}\rangle\langle\mathbf{U}\rangle^{\top}\big)\langle\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}}\rangle\Bigg)\Sigma_{\mathbf{G}}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><msub><mi>𝐠</mi><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">(</mo><munderover><mo lspace="0em" movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi></munderover><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><msup><mi>ψ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>U</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐕</mi><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mi>η</mi><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><msub><mi>𝐲</mi><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mrow><mo rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mi>𝐔</mi><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><msup><mi>𝐕</mi><mi>𝐘</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">)</mo></mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>𝐆</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\langle\mathbf{g}_{*,:}\rangle=\Bigg(\sum_{m=1}^{\mathcal{M}}\langle\psi^{(m)}\rangle\langle\mathbf{x}_{*,U}^{(m)}\rangle\langle\mathbf{V}_{U,:}^{(m)}\rangle+\langle\eta\rangle\big(\langle\mathbf{y}_{*,:}\rangle-\langle\mathbf{z}_{*,:}\rangle\langle\mathbf{U}\rangle^{\top}\big)\langle\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}}\rangle\Bigg)\Sigma_{\mathbf{G}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(21)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="S3.SS4.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS4.p4.1" class="ltx_p">By treating the missing entries as r.v. inferred within the unsupervised iterative process, we avoid potential biases associated with specific classes. The algorithm iteratively parameterizes the distributions of the missing entries to optimize the generative space <math id="S3.SS4.p4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{G}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝐆</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{G}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
<div id="S3.SS4.p5" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS4.p5.1" class="ltx_p">A detailed explanation and further mathematical developments of the posterior predictive distribution and the missing-value imputation are available in the Supplementary Material.</p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="S4" class="ltx_section">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_section">4 </span>Experiments</h2>

<div id="S4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">In this section, we analyze the capabilities and benefits of OSIRIS in an empirical way. First, we evaluate the model’s performance over several clinical and non clinical datasets, both in abscense and precense of missing values. To do so, we compare the model against state-of-the-art baselines, both multi-modal classification models and missing data imputation algorithms. Second, we tested the model over a real clinical problem to assess its capacity to uncover interpretable discriminative and generative factors capturing associations across different modalities.</span></p>
</div>
<section id="S4.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">4.1 </span>Classification Performance</h3>

<figure id="S4.T3" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S4.T3.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 3</span>: </span><span id="S4.T3.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Multimodal datasets used in this study. For each dataset (left to right), we report the number of classes, number of samples, modality dimensions (in parentheses), and a description of the input features.
</span></figcaption>
<div id="S4.T3.5" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:345.0pt;height:98.2pt;vertical-align:-47.1pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-40.5pt,11.5pt) scale(0.8,0.8) ;">
<p id="S4.T3.5.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.T3.5.1.1" class="ltx_text">
<span id="S4.T3.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:425.9pt;height:121.2pt;vertical-align:-58.1pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(0.0pt,0.0pt) scale(1,1) ;">
<span id="S4.T3.5.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.T3.5.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text">
<span id="S4.T3.5.1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<span class="ltx_thead">
<span id="S4.T3.5.1.1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="S4.T3.5.1.1.1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt">Database</span>
<span id="S4.T3.5.1.1.1.1.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt">classes</span>
