<section id="Sx3" class="ltx_section">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section">Data availability</h2>

<div id="Sx3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Sx3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The data used in this project is publicly available and can be downloaded at the following sources: <a href="https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/5/arrhythmia" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_href">Arrhythmia</a>, <a href="https://scikit-learn.org/1.5/auto_examples/datasets/plot_digits_last_image.html" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_href">Digit</a>, <a href="https://landsat.gsfc.nasa.gov/data/" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_href">Sat</a>, <a href="https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/jessicali9530/lfw-dataset" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_href">LFWA</a>, <a href="https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/bothin/fashiongen-validation/data" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_href">Fashion</a>, <a href="https://tadpole.grand-challenge.org/Data/" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_href">Tadpole</a>, <a href="https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/nih-chest-xrays/data" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_href">X-Ray</a>, <a href="https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/zaiyankhan/15scene-dataset" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_href">Scene15</a>, <a href="https://adni.loni.usc.edu/" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_href">ADNI</a>. To replicate the results, the specific data folds used in the experiments are provided in the project GitHub.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Model Inference</h2>

<section id="A1.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.1 </span>Approximate posterior distributions</h3>

<div id="A1.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The model variables follow these prior distributions:</p>
<table id="A1.EGx2" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E22"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E22.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\Xnm" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\Xnm</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E22.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\sim\mathcal{N}\left(\Gn\VmT,\psim^{-1}\Is\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>∼</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>𝐠</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><msup><mi>𝐕</mi><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup></msup><mo>,</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>ψ</mi><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mmultiscripts><msub><mi>𝐈</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\sim\mathcal{N}\left(\Gn\VmT,\psim^{-1}\Is\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(22)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E23"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E23.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\Gn" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝐠</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\Gn</annotation></semantics></math></td>
