</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.p2.1" class="ltx_p">To build the model, we use the mean-field approximation over the model variables <math id="A1.SS1.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{\Theta}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝚯</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{\Theta}</annotation></semantics></math>. As presented in <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib5" title="" class="ltx_ref">5</a>]</cite>, the approximated posterior distribution of each <math id="A1.SS1.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\theta_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\theta_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> will be defined as</p>
<table id="A1.E36" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E36.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="q^{*}(\theta_{i})\propto\mathbb{E}_{\bm{\Theta}_{-i}}\left[\log p(\bm{\Theta},\XM,\Y)\right]," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>q</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>∝</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mi>𝚯</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝚯</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>𝐗</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐘</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q^{*}(\theta_{i})\propto\mathbb{E}_{\bm{\Theta}_{-i}}\left[\log p(\bm{\Theta},\XM,\Y)\right],</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(36)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS1.p2.2" class="ltx_p">where <math id="A1.SS1.p2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bm{\Theta}_{-i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝚯</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bm{\Theta}_{-i}</annotation></semantics></math> includes all variables except <math id="A1.SS1.p2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\theta_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\theta_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>. Moreover, for further developments, the joint model distribution can be defined as:</p>
<table id="A1.E37" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E37.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\begin{split}p(\mathbf{Y},\mathbf{X}^{\mathcal{M}},\mathbf{Z},\mathbf{G},\tau,\eta,\mathbf{V}^{\mathcal{M}},\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}},\mathbf{W}^{\mathcal{M}},\mathbf{U},\bm{\delta}^{\mathcal{M}},\bm{\lambda}^{\mathcal{M}},\bm{\phi}^{\mathcal{M}},\bm{\gamma}^{\mathcal{M}})=p(\mathbf{T}|\mathbf{Y})p(\mathbf{Y}|\mathbf{Z},\mathbf{U},\mathbf{G},\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}},\eta)\\
p(\mathbf{X}^{\mathcal{M}}|\mathbf{G},\mathbf{V}^{\mathcal{M}},\psi)p(\mathbf{G})p(\mathbf{V}^{\mathcal{M}}|\bm{\delta}^{\mathcal{M}},\bm{\lambda}^{\mathcal{M}})p(\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}}|\bm{\delta}^{(M+1)},\bm{\lambda}^{(M+1)})p(\bm{\delta}^{\mathcal{M}})p(\bm{\lambda}^{\mathcal{M}})p(\mathbf{Z}|\mathbf{W}^{\mathcal{M}},\tau)\\
p(\mathbf{W}^{\mathcal{M}}|\bm{\phi}^{\mathcal{M}},\bm{\gamma}^{\mathcal{M}})p(\bm{\phi}^{\mathcal{M}})p(\bm{\gamma}^{\mathcal{M}})p(\mathbf{U})p(\tau)p(\eta)p(\psi^{\mathcal{M}})\end{split}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mtable displaystyle="true" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_right" columnalign="right"><mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐘</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>𝐗</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐙</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐆</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>η</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>𝐕</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>𝐕</mi><mi>𝐘</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>𝐖</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐔</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>𝜹</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>𝝀</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi class="ltx_mathvariant_bold-italic" mathvariant="bold-italic">ϕ</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>𝜸</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐓</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>𝐘</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐘</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><mi>𝐙</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐔</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐆</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>𝐕</mi><mi>𝐘</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><mi>η</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_right" columnalign="right"><mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>𝐗</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><mi>𝐆</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>𝐕</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><mi>ψ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐆</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>𝐕</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msup><mi>𝜹</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>𝝀</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>𝐕</mi><mi>𝐘</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msup><mi>𝜹</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>𝝀</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>𝜹</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>𝝀</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐙</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msup><mi>𝐖</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><mi>τ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_right" columnalign="right"><mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>𝐖</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msup><mi class="ltx_mathvariant_bold-italic" mathvariant="bold-italic">ϕ</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>𝜸</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi class="ltx_mathvariant_bold-italic" mathvariant="bold-italic">ϕ</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>𝜸</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐔</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>η</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>ψ</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\begin{split}p(\mathbf{Y},\mathbf{X}^{\mathcal{M}},\mathbf{Z},\mathbf{G},\tau,\eta,\mathbf{V}^{\mathcal{M}},\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}},\mathbf{W}^{\mathcal{M}},\mathbf{U},\bm{\delta}^{\mathcal{M}},\bm{\lambda}^{\mathcal{M}},\bm{\phi}^{\mathcal{M}},\bm{\gamma}^{\mathcal{M}})=p(\mathbf{T}|\mathbf{Y})p(\mathbf{Y}|\mathbf{Z},\mathbf{U},\mathbf{G},\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}},\eta)\\
p(\mathbf{X}^{\mathcal{M}}|\mathbf{G},\mathbf{V}^{\mathcal{M}},\psi)p(\mathbf{G})p(\mathbf{V}^{\mathcal{M}}|\bm{\delta}^{\mathcal{M}},\bm{\lambda}^{\mathcal{M}})p(\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}}|\bm{\delta}^{(M+1)},\bm{\lambda}^{(M+1)})p(\bm{\delta}^{\mathcal{M}})p(\bm{\lambda}^{\mathcal{M}})p(\mathbf{Z}|\mathbf{W}^{\mathcal{M}},\tau)\\
p(\mathbf{W}^{\mathcal{M}}|\bm{\phi}^{\mathcal{M}},\bm{\gamma}^{\mathcal{M}})p(\bm{\phi}^{\mathcal{M}})p(\bm{\gamma}^{\mathcal{M}})p(\mathbf{U})p(\tau)p(\eta)p(\psi^{\mathcal{M}})\end{split}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(37)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.p3.1" class="ltx_p">This way, we get that the approximated posterior distribution can be written as</p>
<table id="A1.EGx3" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex8"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle q\left(\bm{\Theta}\right)\enskip=" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>𝚯</mi><mo rspace="0.500em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mphantom></mphantom></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle q\left(\bm{\Theta}\right)\enskip=</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex8.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\enskip\prod_{m=1}^{M}\left(q(\mathbf{V}^{(m)})q(\mathbf{W}^{(m)})\,q(\psim)\prod_{k}^{K}\left(q(\delta_{k}^{(m)})q(\phi_{k}^{(m)})\right)\prod_{d}^{D^{(m)}}\left(q(\lambda_{d}^{(m)})q(\gamma_{d}^{(m)})\right)\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∏</mo><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>M</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>𝐕</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>𝐖</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>ψ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∏</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>K</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>δ</mi><mi>k</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>ϕ</mi><mi>k</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∏</mo><mi>d</mi><msup><mi>D</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>λ</mi><mi>d</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>γ</mi><mi>d</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\enskip\prod_{m=1}^{M}\left(q(\mathbf{V}^{(m)})q(\mathbf{W}^{(m)})\,q(\psim)\prod_{k}^{K}\left(q(\delta_{k}^{(m)})q(\phi_{k}^{(m)})\right)\prod_{d}^{D^{(m)}}\left(q(\lambda_{d}^{(m)})q(\gamma_{d}^{(m)})\right)\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E38"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E38.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\enskip q(\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}})q(\mathbf{U})\prod_{n}^{N}\left(q(\mathbf{z}_{\rm n,:})q(\mathbf{g}_{\rm n,:})\right)q(\eta)q(\tau)." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>𝐕</mi><mi>𝐘</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>q</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐔</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∏</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>N</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>q</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>q</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐠</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mi>q</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>η</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>q</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\enskip q(\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}})q(\mathbf{U})\prod_{n}^{N}\left(q(\mathbf{z}_{\rm n,:})q(\mathbf{g}_{\rm n,:})\right)q(\eta)q(\tau).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(38)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<section id="A1.SS1.SSS1" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">A.1.1 </span>Mean field approximation of <math id="A1.SS1.SSS1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{Z}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝐙</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{Z}</annotation></semantics></math></h4>

<div id="A1.SS1.SSS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.SSS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Following the mean-field procedure defined in Eq. (<a href="#A1.E36" title="In A.1 Approximate posterior distributions ‣ Appendix A Model Inference ‣ Interpretable Generative and Discriminative Learning for Multimodal and Incomplete Clinical Data" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">36</span></a>), we define the approximated posterior distribution of <math id="A1.SS1.SSS1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{Z}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝐙</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{Z}</annotation></semantics></math> as:</p>
<table id="A1.E39" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E39.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ln q(\mathbf{Z})=\mathbb{E}[\ln p(\mathbf{Y}|\mathbf{Z},\mathbf{U},\mathbf{G},\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}},\eta)+\ln p(\mathbf{Z}|\mathbf{W}^{\mathcal{M}},\tau)]." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐙</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐘</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><mi>𝐙</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐔</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐆</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>𝐕</mi><mi>𝐘</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><mi>η</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐙</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msup><mi>𝐖</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><mi>τ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ln q(\mathbf{Z})=\mathbb{E}[\ln p(\mathbf{Y}|\mathbf{Z},\mathbf{U},\mathbf{G},\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}},\eta)+\ln p(\mathbf{Z}|\mathbf{W}^{\mathcal{M}},\tau)].</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(39)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.SSS1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.SSS1.p2.1" class="ltx_p">Thus, we can develop the first term of the summation as:</p>
<table id="A1.E40" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E40.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\begin{split}&amp;\ln p(\mathbf{Y}|\mathbf{Z},\mathbf{U},\mathbf{G},\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}},\eta)=\sum_{n}^{N}\ln\mathcal{N}\left(\Zn\UT+\Gn\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}\top},\eta^{-1}\Ic\right)\\
&amp;=\sum_{n}^{N}\left(-\frac{1}{2}\ln(2\pi)+\frac{1}{2}\ln(\eta)-\frac{\eta}{2}\left(\Yn-\Zn\UT-\Gn\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}\top}\right)\left(\Yn-\Zn\UT-\Gn\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}\top}\right)^{\top}\right)\\
&amp;=\sum_{n}^{N}\Big(-\frac{1}{2}\ln(2\pi)+\frac{1}{2}\ln(\eta)-\frac{\eta}{2}\Big[\Yn\Yn^{\top}-2\Yn\U\Zn^{\top}-2\Yn\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}}\Gn^{\top}+\Zn\UT\U\Zn^{\top}\\
&amp;+\Gn\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}\top}\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}}\Gn^{\top}+2\Zn\UT\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}}\Gn^{\top}\Big]\Big).\end{split}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mtable columnspacing="0pt" displaystyle="true" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_right" columnalign="right"><mphantom></mphantom></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐘</mi><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐙</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐔</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐆</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐕</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>𝐘</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><mi>η</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>n</mi></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>N</mi></msup><mi>ln</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><msup><mi>𝐔</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>𝐠</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><mi>𝐕</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>𝐘</mi><mo lspace="0.222em">⊤</mo></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mi>η</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msub><mi>𝐈</mi><mi>C</mi></msub><mo>)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mo movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>n</mi></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>N</mi></msup><mo>(</mo><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>ln</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>ln</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>η</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mi>η</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>𝐲</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><msup><mi>𝐔</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>𝐠</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><mi>𝐕</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>𝐘</mi><mo lspace="0.222em">⊤</mo></mrow></msup><mo>)</mo><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>𝐲</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><msup><mi>𝐔</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>𝐠</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><mi>𝐕</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>𝐘</mi><mo lspace="0.222em">⊤</mo></mrow></msup><mo>)</mo><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo>)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mo movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>n</mi></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>N</mi></msup><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>ln</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>ln</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>η</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mi>η</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">[</mo><mrow><mi>𝐲</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>𝐲</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>𝐲</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><mi>𝐔</mi><mrow><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>𝐲</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><mi>𝐕</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>𝐘</mi></msup><mrow><mi>𝐠</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><msup><mi>𝐔</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mi>𝐔</mi><mrow><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>𝐠</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><mi>𝐕</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>𝐘</mi><mo lspace="0.222em">⊤</mo></mrow></msup><mi>𝐕</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>𝐘</mi></msup><mrow><mi>𝐠</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><msup><mi>𝐔</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mi>𝐕</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>𝐘</mi></msup><mrow><mi>𝐠</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">]</mo><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\begin{split}&amp;\ln p(\mathbf{Y}|\mathbf{Z},\mathbf{U},\mathbf{G},\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}},\eta)=\sum_{n}^{N}\ln\mathcal{N}\left(\Zn\UT+\Gn\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}\top},\eta^{-1}\Ic\right)\\
&amp;=\sum_{n}^{N}\left(-\frac{1}{2}\ln(2\pi)+\frac{1}{2}\ln(\eta)-\frac{\eta}{2}\left(\Yn-\Zn\UT-\Gn\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}\top}\right)\left(\Yn-\Zn\UT-\Gn\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}\top}\right)^{\top}\right)\\
&amp;=\sum_{n}^{N}\Big(-\frac{1}{2}\ln(2\pi)+\frac{1}{2}\ln(\eta)-\frac{\eta}{2}\Big[\Yn\Yn^{\top}-2\Yn\U\Zn^{\top}-2\Yn\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}}\Gn^{\top}+\Zn\UT\U\Zn^{\top}\\
&amp;+\Gn\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}\top}\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}}\Gn^{\top}+2\Zn\UT\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}}\Gn^{\top}\Big]\Big).\end{split}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(40)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.SSS1.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.SSS1.p3.1" class="ltx_p">Hence, if we adapt Eq. (<a href="#A1.E40" title="In A.1.1 Mean field approximation of 𝐙 ‣ A.1 Approximate posterior distributions ‣ Appendix A Model Inference ‣ Interpretable Generative and Discriminative Learning for Multimodal and Incomplete Clinical Data" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">40</span></a>) focusing solely on <math id="A1.SS1.SSS1.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{Z}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝐙</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{Z}</annotation></semantics></math>, treating as constants all terms that do not depend on this variable:</p>
<table id="A1.E41" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E41.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\begin{split}&amp;\ln p(\mathbf{Y}|\mathbf{Z},\mathbf{U},\mathbf{G},\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}},\eta)=\sum_{n}^{N}-\frac{\eta}{2}\left(-2-2\Yn\U\Zn^{\top}+\Zn\UT\U\Zn^{\top}+2\Zn\UT\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}}\Gn^{\top}\right)\\
&amp;=\eta\sum_{n}^{N}\left(\Yn\U\Zn^{\top}-\frac{1}{2}\Zn\UT\U\Zn^{\top}-\Zn\UT\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}}\Gn^{\top}\right)+\text{const}.\end{split}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mtable columnspacing="0pt" displaystyle="true" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_right" columnalign="right"><mphantom></mphantom></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐘</mi><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐙</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐔</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐆</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐕</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>𝐘</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><mi>η</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mo movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>n</mi></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>N</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mfrac><mi>η</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>(</mo><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>𝐲</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><mi>𝐔</mi><mrow><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><msup><mi>𝐔</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mi>𝐔</mi><mrow><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><msup><mi>𝐔</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mi>𝐕</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>𝐘</mi></msup><mrow><mi>𝐠</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo>)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>η</mi><mo movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>n</mi></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>N</mi></msup><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>𝐲</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><mi>𝐔</mi><mrow><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mrow><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><msup><mi>𝐔</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mi>𝐔</mi><mrow><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><msup><mi>𝐔</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mi>𝐕</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>𝐘</mi></msup><mrow><mi>𝐠</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mtext>const</mtext><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\begin{split}&amp;\ln p(\mathbf{Y}|\mathbf{Z},\mathbf{U},\mathbf{G},\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}},\eta)=\sum_{n}^{N}-\frac{\eta}{2}\left(-2-2\Yn\U\Zn^{\top}+\Zn\UT\U\Zn^{\top}+2\Zn\UT\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}}\Gn^{\top}\right)\\
&amp;=\eta\sum_{n}^{N}\left(\Yn\U\Zn^{\top}-\frac{1}{2}\Zn\UT\U\Zn^{\top}-\Zn\UT\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}}\Gn^{\top}\right)+\text{const}.\end{split}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(41)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.SSS1.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.SSS1.p4.1" class="ltx_p">The second term of Eq. (<a href="#A1.E39" title="In A.1.1 Mean field approximation of 𝐙 ‣ A.1 Approximate posterior distributions ‣ Appendix A Model Inference ‣ Interpretable Generative and Discriminative Learning for Multimodal and Incomplete Clinical Data" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">39</span></a>) can be expressed as:</p>
<table id="A1.E42" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E42.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\ln p(\mathbf{Z}|\mathbf{W}^{\mathcal{M}},\tau)=\sum_{n}^{N}-\frac{1}{2}\tau\left(\Zn\Zn^{\top}-\Zn\sum_{m}^{M}\left(\Xnm\WmT\right)\right)+\text{const}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐙</mi><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msup><mi>𝐖</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><munderover><mo movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>N</mi></munderover><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><msup><mrow><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><munderover><mo movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>M</mi></munderover><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><msup><mi>𝐖</mi><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup></msup><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mtext>const</mtext><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ln p(\mathbf{Z}|\mathbf{W}^{\mathcal{M}},\tau)=\sum_{n}^{N}-\frac{1}{2}\tau\left(\Zn\Zn^{\top}-\Zn\sum_{m}^{M}\left(\Xnm\WmT\right)\right)+\text{const}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(42)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.SSS1.p5" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.SSS1.p5.1" class="ltx_p">We can now combine Eq. (<a href="#A1.E41" title="In A.1.1 Mean field approximation of 𝐙 ‣ A.1 Approximate posterior distributions ‣ Appendix A Model Inference ‣ Interpretable Generative and Discriminative Learning for Multimodal and Incomplete Clinical Data" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">41</span></a>) and Eq. (<a href="#A1.E42" title="In A.1.1 Mean field approximation of 𝐙 ‣ A.1 Approximate posterior distributions ‣ Appendix A Model Inference ‣ Interpretable Generative and Discriminative Learning for Multimodal and Incomplete Clinical Data" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">42</span></a>) in order to apply the expectation operator and identify the relevant terms:</p>
<table id="A1.E43" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E43.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\begin{split}&amp;\ln q(\mathbf{Z})=\mathbb{E}\Big[\sum_{n}^{N}\Big(\Zn\eta\UT\Yn^{\top}-\frac{1}{2}\Zn\eta\UT\U\Zn^{\top}-\Zn\eta\UT\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}\top}\Gn^{\top}-\frac{1}{2}\Zn\tau\Zn^{\top}\\
&amp;+\Zn\tau\sum_{m}^{M}\left(\Xnm\WmT\right)\Big)\Big]+\text{const}\\
&amp;=\sum_{n}^{N}\mathbb{E}\Bigg[\Zn\left(\eta\UT\Yn^{\top}-\eta\UT\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}}\Gn^{\top}+\tau\sum_{m}^{M}\left(\Xnm\WmT\right)\right)\\
&amp;-\frac{1}{2}\Zn\left(\eta\UT\U+\tau\Ik\right)\Zn^{\top}\Bigg]+\text{const}\\
&amp;=\sum_{n}^{N}\Bigg(\Zn\left(\langle\eta\rangle\langle\UT\rangle\langle\Yn^{\top}\rangle-\langle\eta\rangle\langle\UT\rangle\langle\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}}\rangle\langle\Gn^{\top}\rangle+\langle\tau\rangle\sum_{m}^{M}\left(\Xnm\langle\WmT\rangle\right)\right)\\
&amp;-\frac{1}{2}\Zn\left(\langle\eta\rangle\langle\UT\U\rangle+\langle\tau\rangle\Ik\right)\Zn^{\top}\Bigg)+\text{const}\end{split}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mtable columnspacing="0pt" displaystyle="true" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐙</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">[</mo><mo lspace="0em" movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>n</mi></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>N</mi></msup><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mrow><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><mi>η</mi><msup><mi>𝐔</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mrow><mi>𝐲</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mrow><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><mi>η</mi><msup><mi>𝐔</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mi>𝐔</mi><mrow><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><mi>η</mi><msup><mi>𝐔</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mi>𝐕</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>𝐘</mi><mo lspace="0.222em">⊤</mo></mrow></msup><mrow><mi>𝐠</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mrow><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>m</mi></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>M</mi></msup><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><msup><mi>𝐖</mi><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup></msup><mo>)</mo><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">]</mo><mo>+</mo><mtext>const</mtext></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>n</mi></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>N</mi></msup><mi>𝔼</mi><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">[</mo><mrow><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>η</mi><msup><mi>𝐔</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mrow><mi>𝐲</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>η</mi><msup><mi>𝐔</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mi>𝐕</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>𝐘</mi></msup><mrow><mi>𝐠</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>m</mi></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>M</mi></msup><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><msup><mi>𝐖</mi><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup></msup><mo>)</mo><mo>)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mrow><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>η</mi><msup><mi>𝐔</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mi>𝐔</mi><mo lspace="0em">+</mo><mi>τ</mi><msub><mi>𝐈</mi><mi>K</mi></msub><mo>)</mo><mrow><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">]</mo><mo>+</mo><mtext>const</mtext></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mo movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>n</mi></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>N</mi></msup><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">(</mo><mrow><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>(</mo><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mi>η</mi><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><msup><mi>𝐔</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><mi>𝐲</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mi>η</mi><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><msup><mi>𝐔</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mi>𝐕</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>𝐘</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><mi>𝐠</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo><mo movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>m</mi></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>M</mi></msup><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><msup><mi>𝐖</mi><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup></msup><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo><mo>)</mo><mo>)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mrow><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>(</mo><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mi>η</mi><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><msup><mi>𝐔</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mi>𝐔</mi><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo><msub><mi>𝐈</mi><mi>K</mi></msub><mo>)</mo><mrow><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mtext>const</mtext></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\begin{split}&amp;\ln q(\mathbf{Z})=\mathbb{E}\Big[\sum_{n}^{N}\Big(\Zn\eta\UT\Yn^{\top}-\frac{1}{2}\Zn\eta\UT\U\Zn^{\top}-\Zn\eta\UT\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}\top}\Gn^{\top}-\frac{1}{2}\Zn\tau\Zn^{\top}\\
&amp;+\Zn\tau\sum_{m}^{M}\left(\Xnm\WmT\right)\Big)\Big]+\text{const}\\
&amp;=\sum_{n}^{N}\mathbb{E}\Bigg[\Zn\left(\eta\UT\Yn^{\top}-\eta\UT\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}}\Gn^{\top}+\tau\sum_{m}^{M}\left(\Xnm\WmT\right)\right)\\
&amp;-\frac{1}{2}\Zn\left(\eta\UT\U+\tau\Ik\right)\Zn^{\top}\Bigg]+\text{const}\\
&amp;=\sum_{n}^{N}\Bigg(\Zn\left(\langle\eta\rangle\langle\UT\rangle\langle\Yn^{\top}\rangle-\langle\eta\rangle\langle\UT\rangle\langle\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}}\rangle\langle\Gn^{\top}\rangle+\langle\tau\rangle\sum_{m}^{M}\left(\Xnm\langle\WmT\rangle\right)\right)\\
&amp;-\frac{1}{2}\Zn\left(\langle\eta\rangle\langle\UT\U\rangle+\langle\tau\rangle\Ik\right)\Zn^{\top}\Bigg)+\text{const}\end{split}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(43)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.SSS1.p6" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.SSS1.p6.1" class="ltx_p">Thus, we can identify the different elements and subsequently parameterize the approximated posterior</p>
<table id="A1.E44" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E44.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="q(\Zn)=\mathcal{N}(\langle\Zn\rangle,\Sigma_{\Z}^{-1})" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>𝐙</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q(\Zn)=\mathcal{N}(\langle\Zn\rangle,\Sigma_{\Z}^{-1})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(44)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS1.SSS1.p6.2" class="ltx_p">where</p>
<table id="A1.EGx4" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E45"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E45.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\Sigma_{\mathbf{Z}}^{-1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>𝐙</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\Sigma_{\mathbf{Z}}^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E45.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\langle\tau\rangle\Ik+\langle\eta\rangle\langle\mathbf{U}^{\top}\mathbf{U}\rangle" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐈</mi><mi>K</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mi>η</mi><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><msup><mi>𝐔</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐔</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\langle\tau\rangle\Ik+\langle\eta\rangle\langle\mathbf{U}^{\top}\mathbf{U}\rangle</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(45)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E46"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E46.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\langle\mathbf{z}_{\rm n,:}\rangle" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\langle\mathbf{z}_{\rm n,:}\rangle</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E46.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle=\left(\langle\tau\rangle\sum_{m}^{M}\mathbf{x}_{\rm n,:}^{(m)}\langle\mathbf{W}^{(m)}\rangle^{\top}+\langle\eta\rangle\left(\langle\mathbf{y}_{\rm n,:}\rangle-\langle\mathbf{g}_{\rm n,:}\rangle\langle\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}}\rangle^{\top}\right)\langle\mathbf{U}\rangle\right)\Sigma_{\mathbf{Z}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>M</mi></munderover></mstyle><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><msup><mi>𝐖</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mi>η</mi><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><msub><mi>𝐲</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><msub><mi>𝐠</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><msup><mi>𝐕</mi><mi>𝐘</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mi>𝐔</mi><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>𝐙</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\left(\langle\tau\rangle\sum_{m}^{M}\mathbf{x}_{\rm n,:}^{(m)}\langle\mathbf{W}^{(m)}\rangle^{\top}+\langle\eta\rangle\left(\langle\mathbf{y}_{\rm n,:}\rangle-\langle\mathbf{g}_{\rm n,:}\rangle\langle\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}}\rangle^{\top}\right)\langle\mathbf{U}\rangle\right)\Sigma_{\mathbf{Z}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(46)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS1.SSS2" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">A.1.2 </span>Mean field approximation of <math id="A1.SS1.SSS2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{G}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝐆</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{G}</annotation></semantics></math></h4>

<div id="A1.SS1.SSS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.SSS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Following Eq. (<a href="#A1.E36" title="In A.1 Approximate posterior distributions ‣ Appendix A Model Inference ‣ Interpretable Generative and Discriminative Learning for Multimodal and Incomplete Clinical Data" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">36</span></a>), we define</p>
<table id="A1.E47" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E47.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ln q(\G)=\mathbb{E}[\ln p(\G)+\ln p(\X|\G,\V^{\mathcal{M}},\psi^{\mathcal{M}})+\ln p(\Y|\Z,\U,\G,\mathbf{V}^{(M+1)},\eta)]" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐆</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐆</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐗</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0.167em">|</mo><mrow><mi>𝐆</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>𝐕</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>ψ</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐘</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0.167em">|</mo><mrow><mi>𝐙</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐔</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐆</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>𝐕</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mi>η</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ln q(\G)=\mathbb{E}[\ln p(\G)+\ln p(\X|\G,\V^{\mathcal{M}},\psi^{\mathcal{M}})+\ln p(\Y|\Z,\U,\G,\mathbf{V}^{(M+1)},\eta)]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(47)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.SSS2.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.SSS2.p2.1" class="ltx_p">First term is developed as follows:</p>
<table id="A1.E48" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E48.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\ln p(\G)=\sum_{n}^{N}\left(-\frac{1}{2}\Gn\Gn^{\top}\right)+\text{const}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐆</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><munderover><mo movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>N</mi></munderover><mrow><mo>(</mo><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mrow><mi>𝐠</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><msup><mrow><mi>𝐠</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mtext>const</mtext><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ln p(\G)=\sum_{n}^{N}\left(-\frac{1}{2}\Gn\Gn^{\top}\right)+\text{const}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(48)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.SSS2.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.SSS2.p3.1" class="ltx_p">Second term as:</p>
<table id="A1.E49" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E49.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\ln p(\X|\G,\V^{\mathcal{M}},\psi^{\mathcal{M}})=\sum_{m}^{M}\sum_{n}^{N}\left(\psi^{(m)}\Xnm\V\Gn^{\top}-\frac{\psim}{2}\Gn\VmT\Vm\Gn^{\top}\right)+\text{const}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐗</mi><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐆</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>𝐕</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>ψ</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><munderover><mo movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>M</mi></munderover><munderover><mo movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>N</mi></munderover><mrow><mo>(</mo><msup><mi>ψ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mrow><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><mi>𝐕</mi><msup><mrow><mi>𝐠</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>ψ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mrow><mi>𝐠</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><msup><mi>𝐕</mi><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup></msup><msup><mi>𝐕</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi>𝐠</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mtext>const</mtext><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ln p(\X|\G,\V^{\mathcal{M}},\psi^{\mathcal{M}})=\sum_{m}^{M}\sum_{n}^{N}\left(\psi^{(m)}\Xnm\V\Gn^{\top}-\frac{\psim}{2}\Gn\VmT\Vm\Gn^{\top}\right)+\text{const}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(49)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.SSS2.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.SSS2.p4.1" class="ltx_p">Third term is analogous to Eq. (<a href="#A1.E40" title="In A.1.1 Mean field approximation of 𝐙 ‣ A.1 Approximate posterior distributions ‣ Appendix A Model Inference ‣ Interpretable Generative and Discriminative Learning for Multimodal and Incomplete Clinical Data" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">40</span></a>) as:</p>
<table id="A1.E50" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E50.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\begin{split}\ln p(\Y|\Z,\U,\G,\mathbf{V}^{(M+1)},\eta)&amp;=\sum_{n}^{N}\Big(-\frac{\eta}{2}\Big[-2\Yn\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}}\Gn^{\top}+\Gn\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}}\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}\top}\Gn^{\top}\\
&amp;+2\Zn\UT\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}}\Gn^{\top}\Big]\Big)+\text{const}.\end{split}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mtable columnspacing="0pt" displaystyle="true" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_right" columnalign="right"><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐘</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0.167em">|</mo><mrow><mi>𝐙</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐔</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐆</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>𝐕</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mi>η</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mo movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>n</mi></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>N</mi></msup><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mfrac><mi>η</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">[</mo><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>𝐲</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><mi>𝐕</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>𝐘</mi></msup><mrow><mi>𝐠</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>𝐠</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><mi>𝐕</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>𝐘</mi></msup><mi>𝐕</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>𝐘</mi><mo lspace="0.222em">⊤</mo></mrow></msup><mrow><mi>𝐠</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><msup><mi>𝐔</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mi>𝐕</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>𝐘</mi></msup><mrow><mi>𝐠</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">]</mo><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mtext>const</mtext><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\begin{split}\ln p(\Y|\Z,\U,\G,\mathbf{V}^{(M+1)},\eta)&amp;=\sum_{n}^{N}\Big(-\frac{\eta}{2}\Big[-2\Yn\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}}\Gn^{\top}+\Gn\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}}\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}\top}\Gn^{\top}\\
&amp;+2\Zn\UT\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}}\Gn^{\top}\Big]\Big)+\text{const}.\end{split}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(50)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.SSS2.p5" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.SSS2.p5.1" class="ltx_p">We combine Eq. (<a href="#A1.E48" title="In A.1.2 Mean field approximation of 𝐆 ‣ A.1 Approximate posterior distributions ‣ Appendix A Model Inference ‣ Interpretable Generative and Discriminative Learning for Multimodal and Incomplete Clinical Data" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">48</span></a>), (<a href="#A1.E49" title="In A.1.2 Mean field approximation of 𝐆 ‣ A.1 Approximate posterior distributions ‣ Appendix A Model Inference ‣ Interpretable Generative and Discriminative Learning for Multimodal and Incomplete Clinical Data" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">49</span></a>) and (<a href="#A1.E50" title="In A.1.2 Mean field approximation of 𝐆 ‣ A.1 Approximate posterior distributions ‣ Appendix A Model Inference ‣ Interpretable Generative and Discriminative Learning for Multimodal and Incomplete Clinical Data" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">50</span></a>) as:</p>
<table id="A1.E51" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E51.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\begin{split}&amp;\ln q(\G)=\mathbb{E}\Bigg[\sum_{n}^{N}\Bigg(\sum_{m}^{M}\left(\psim\Xnm\Vm\right)\Gn^{\top}-\frac{1}{2}\Gn\sum_{m}^{M}\left(\psim\VmT\Vm\right)\Gn^{\top}\\
&amp;-\frac{1}{2}\Gn\Gn^{\top}+\eta\Yn\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}}\Gn^{\top}-\frac{1}{2}\Gn\left(\eta\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}}\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}\top}\right)\Gn^{\top}-\eta\Zn\UT\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}}\Gn^{\top}\Bigg)\Bigg]+\text{const}\\
&amp;=\sum_{n}^{N}\Bigg(\Bigg[\sum_{m}^{M}\langle\psim\rangle\Xnm\langle\Vm\rangle+\langle\eta\rangle\langle\Yn\rangle\langle\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}}\rangle-\langle\eta\rangle\langle\Zn\rangle\langle\UT\rangle\langle\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}}\rangle\Bigg]\Gn^{\top}\\
&amp;-\frac{1}{2}\Gn\left(\sum_{m}^{M}\left(\langle\psim\rangle\langle\VmT\Vm\rangle\right)+\Is+\langle\eta\rangle\langle\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}\top}\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}}\rangle\right)\Gn^{\top}\Bigg)+\text{const}.\end{split}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mtable columnspacing="0pt" displaystyle="true" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐆</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">[</mo><mo lspace="0em" movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>n</mi></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>N</mi></msup><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>m</mi></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>M</mi></msup><mo>(</mo><msup><mi>ψ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mrow><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><msup><mi>𝐕</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo>)</mo><mrow><mi>𝐠</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mrow><mi>𝐠</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><mo movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>m</mi></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>M</mi></msup><mo>(</mo><msup><mi>ψ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><msup><mi>𝐕</mi><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup></msup><msup><mi>𝐕</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo>)</mo><mrow><mi>𝐠</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mrow><mi>𝐠</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>𝐠</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>η</mi><mrow><mi>𝐲</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><mi>𝐕</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>𝐘</mi></msup><mrow><mi>𝐠</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mrow><mi>𝐠</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>η</mi><mi>𝐕</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>𝐘</mi></msup><mi>𝐕</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>𝐘</mi><mo lspace="0.222em">⊤</mo></mrow></msup><mo>)</mo><mrow><mi>𝐠</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>η</mi><mrow><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><msup><mi>𝐔</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mi>𝐕</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>𝐘</mi></msup><mrow><mi>𝐠</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">)</mo><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">]</mo><mo>+</mo><mtext>const</mtext></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mo movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>n</mi></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>N</mi></msup><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">(</mo><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">[</mo><mo lspace="0em" movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>m</mi></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>M</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><msup><mi>ψ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo><mrow><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><msup><mi>𝐕</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mi>η</mi><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><mi>𝐲</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mi>𝐕</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>𝐘</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mi>η</mi><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><msup><mi>𝐔</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mi>𝐕</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>𝐘</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">]</mo><mrow><mi>𝐠</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mrow><mi>𝐠</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>(</mo><mo lspace="0em" movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>m</mi></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>M</mi></msup><mo>(</mo><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><msup><mi>ψ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><msup><mi>𝐕</mi><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup></msup><msup><mi>𝐕</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>𝐈</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mi>η</mi><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mi>𝐕</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>𝐘</mi><mo lspace="0.222em">⊤</mo></mrow></msup><mi>𝐕</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>𝐘</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo><mo>)</mo><mrow><mi>𝐠</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mtext>const</mtext><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\begin{split}&amp;\ln q(\G)=\mathbb{E}\Bigg[\sum_{n}^{N}\Bigg(\sum_{m}^{M}\left(\psim\Xnm\Vm\right)\Gn^{\top}-\frac{1}{2}\Gn\sum_{m}^{M}\left(\psim\VmT\Vm\right)\Gn^{\top}\\
&amp;-\frac{1}{2}\Gn\Gn^{\top}+\eta\Yn\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}}\Gn^{\top}-\frac{1}{2}\Gn\left(\eta\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}}\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}\top}\right)\Gn^{\top}-\eta\Zn\UT\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}}\Gn^{\top}\Bigg)\Bigg]+\text{const}\\
&amp;=\sum_{n}^{N}\Bigg(\Bigg[\sum_{m}^{M}\langle\psim\rangle\Xnm\langle\Vm\rangle+\langle\eta\rangle\langle\Yn\rangle\langle\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}}\rangle-\langle\eta\rangle\langle\Zn\rangle\langle\UT\rangle\langle\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}}\rangle\Bigg]\Gn^{\top}\\
&amp;-\frac{1}{2}\Gn\left(\sum_{m}^{M}\left(\langle\psim\rangle\langle\VmT\Vm\rangle\right)+\Is+\langle\eta\rangle\langle\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}\top}\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}}\rangle\right)\Gn^{\top}\Bigg)+\text{const}.\end{split}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(51)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.SSS2.p6" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.SSS2.p6.1" class="ltx_p">Hence, identifying the elements we can parameterize:</p>
<table id="A1.E52" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E52.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="q(\Gn)=\mathcal{N}\left(\langle\Gn\rangle,\Sigma_{\G}^{-1}\right)," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>𝐠</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><mi>𝐠</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>𝐆</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q(\Gn)=\mathcal{N}\left(\langle\Gn\rangle,\Sigma_{\G}^{-1}\right),</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(52)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS1.SSS2.p6.2" class="ltx_p">where</p>
<table id="A1.EGx5" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E53"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E53.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\Sigma_{\mathbf{G}}^{-1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mi>𝐆</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\Sigma_{\mathbf{G}}^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E53.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\Is+\langle\eta\rangle\langle\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}\top}\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}}\rangle+\sum_{m}^{M}\langle\psi^{(m)}\rangle\langle\mathbf{V}^{(m)^{\top}}\mathbf{V}^{(m)}\rangle" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐈</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mi>η</mi><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><msup><mi>𝐕</mi><mrow><mi>𝐘</mi><mo lspace="0.222em">⊤</mo></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐕</mi><mi>𝐘</mi></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>M</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><msup><mi>ψ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><msup><mi>𝐕</mi><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐕</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\Is+\langle\eta\rangle\langle\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}\top}\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}}\rangle+\sum_{m}^{M}\langle\psi^{(m)}\rangle\langle\mathbf{V}^{(m)^{\top}}\mathbf{V}^{(m)}\rangle</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(53)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E54"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E54.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\langle\mathbf{g}_{\rm n,:}\rangle" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><msub><mi>𝐠</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\langle\mathbf{g}_{\rm n,:}\rangle</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E54.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle=\left(\sum_{m}^{M}\left(\langle\psi^{(m)}\rangle\mathbf{x}_{\rm n,:}^{(m)}\langle\mathbf{V}^{(m)}\rangle\right)+\langle\eta\rangle\left(\langle\mathbf{y}_{n,:}\rangle-\langle\mathbf{z}_{\rm n,:}\rangle\langle\mathbf{U}\rangle^{\top}\right)\langle\mathbf{V}^{\mathbf{Y}}\rangle\right)\Sigma_{\mathbf{G}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>M</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><msup><mi>ψ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>:</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><msup><mi>𝐕</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mi>η</mi><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow>